# ---- build output -----------------------------------------------------------
# Release zips are attached to GitHub Releases, not committed.
dist/

# ---- the compiled overlay ---------------------------------------------------
# Kept out of the working tree; `overlay/build.ps1` rebuilds it, and the release
# archive ships a prebuilt copy for people who only want to run it. The GUID-prefixed
# copies are what the build writes when a running instance has the exe locked.
overlay/DynamicIsland.exe
overlay/*_DynamicIsland.exe
overlay/*.pdb
overlay/obj/
overlay/bin/

# ---- runtime artefacts ------------------------------------------------------
# State snapshots, logs, personal settings and debug captures written while it runs.
overlay/island.state.txt
overlay/island.log
overlay/island.settings.json
overlay/*.state
overlay/*.state.txt
overlay/*.log
overlay/*.settings.json
overlay/*.json
overlay/*.png
overlay/live-test-*

# ---- plugin runtime state ---------------------------------------------------
# The host half announces its endpoint here at runtime; never commit it.
lib/*.state.json
dynamic-island.state.json
dynamic-island.approval.json
dev/dynamic-island.state.json

# ---- research notes ---------------------------------------------------------
# Extracted notes about the official client packages. Read them locally, but do not
# redistribute vendor files: keep this out of the public repository.
dev/ref/

# ---- editors / node ---------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
